<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Derivations and proofs ‣ Part I Appendix ‣ Locality in Image Diffusion ModelsEmerges from Data Statistics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>“Pass-through” denoisers: detailed analysis of SNR</span></a></li>
